OL,3,AUkraine air raid app apparently hacked
OL,4,Aas users receive false radiation
OL,5,Athreat, Air Force says
OL,6,
OL,7,FUkraine's air raid alert app was
OL,8,Fapparently hacked on Sunday and for a
OL,9,Fshort time said the capital Kyiv was
OL,10,Fsubject to a radiation threat, the
OL,11,FUkrainian Air Force has said.
OL,13,FThe alert on Telegram read: "The Air
OL,14,FAlarm application has probably been
OL,15,Fsubjected to hostile interference.
OL,16,FThere is no radiation threat! Stay calm
OL,17,Fand follow our updates on our channel."
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
