OL,3,AUkraine air raid app apparently hacked
OL,4,Aas users receive false radiation
OL,5,Athreat, Air Force says
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Ukrainian Central Intelligence
OL,8,FAgency said there had been a failure in
OL,9,Fthe app, and urged people to use other
OL,10,Fsources of information to clarify the
OL,11,Fsituation on the threat of air strikes.
OL,13,FA few hours later Russian authorities
OL,14,Fsaid its app was hacked. A Ukrainian
OL,15,Fespionage group reportedly sent fake
OL,16,Fwarnings of nuclear strikes inside
OL,17,FRussia.
